OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dreams of Ironman success
OL,4,Aafter boat accident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired police officer from Kent is
OL,7,Fset to compete in the Ironman World
OL,8,FChampionship in Hawaii after overcoming
OL,9,Fa serious injury that threatened to end
OL,10,Fher racing ambitions.
OL,12,FCatherine Linney from Sevenoaks had
OL,13,Fspent seven months recovering from a
OL,14,Fboat accident in 2025 which resulted in
OL,15,Fa complex ankle stress fracture and an
OL,16,Fosteoporosis diagnosis.
OL,18,FDespite having only 12 weeks to prepare
OL,19,Ffor her first full Ironman challenge,
OL,20,Fshe came first in the 55-59 age group
OL,21,Fin Leeds to qualify for the World
OL,22,FChampionship in Kona.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
